    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú mibeeri tsár nee tám oo waawuti'iimár Yoashi waawutmoó Yuda, Yehoahasi garmoó Yehu waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún baraá yaamaá Israeliro amór gixsár Samaria. Inós kureeri ngaa /aáy baraá waawuti'iimaro a mibaá nee faanqw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós tlakweema gina tleéhh geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE adoodár Yeroboamu garmoó Nebati, kudá' múk Israeli gwa baraá tlakweemáy dahaas, Yehoahasi tlehhmi'iiká' tlakw tlehhtuuwo gaa mayká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iri ló'wa buúhh, múk Israeli guri ya/án kuwa baliiti baraá slaqwaraaro nee múk waawutmo Hasaeli oo Aramu nee garmaawós Ben-hadadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guri harhheehhe'eés, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ adoodá' múk Israeli kura slahh'eemiís nee waawutmoó Aramu ngiwa ár, firor'ín gari iiaárí qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ múk Israeli guri geeraharusmoó i sláy oo gaa tuu/ dír múk Aramu wa ale. Tari hoót ar wayda ar adoodár geera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe múk Israeli tlakweema tlehhtuuwo gaa mayká, kudaá waawutmo Yeroboamu múk Israeli nguwa baraá tlakweemáy dahaás, ala tana kumiít tlakweema tlehhtuuwo nee Ashera munguúín kuduú /ameeni, ina meér baraá Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi slaqwaruuse ga konká, ala gár i kon aqo har múk farsuú madiít oo mibeeri kooán, nee gaardu mibaangw, nee slaqwaruusér ya'ár hi'iimiit a kume mibángw wák. Gár tas adoorí a waawutmoó Aramu slaqwaruusér múk Israeli gana hhaamiís, nee gari yaamaá hara adáh adór teerír wa aleeró.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' sleémeero awa Yehoahasi aa tleéhh nee migtose kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú qom'aá waawituú Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahasi iri gwaá', kuri foól baraá Samaria, nee garmaawós Yehoashi iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú mibeeri tám nee faanqw oo waawuti'iimár Yoashi oo Yuda, Yehoashi garmoó Yehoahasi, waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún baraá Israeliro, amór Samaria. Inós baraá waawuti'iimaro kureeri ngaa /aáy a mibaá nee lahhoó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoashi sleeme tlakweema gina tleéhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE nee loohidár Yeroboamu garmoó Nebati gana eehár, kudá' múk Israeli gwa qwaarees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' awa waawutmo Yehoashi nee migtose nee slaqwaradá' taa slaáqw nee waawutmo Amasia oo Yuda kaa gooín baraá kitaábuú qom'aá waawituú Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoashi iri gwaá', kuri foól baraá /aantaá waawitá, baraá gixsár Samaria. Nee garmaawós Yeroboamu oo tsár iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa aleeró.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aarusmo Elisha tiqti guri /uurúr ót. Qoomár gwa'ara ngiwa áy, waawutmo Yehoashi oo Israeli guri neetleesi áy. Iwa hardáh iri dír geeraá Elisha wa /aá/, iri oó', «Baabuúeé', baabuúeé', gaardaá múk Israeli nee mukduú farsuú madiít.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha iri oó', «Xáda, ga/ale nee maheeri hanisang.» Yehoashi giri huúw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha iri oó', «Ti amohhe'es mahaangw tsaxaararo.» Elisha dabaawós giri qaás gawaá dabaá waawutmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo adoodá' Elisha aa oó' gana tleéhh, nee pa/aangwdá' aa amór yaamaá múk Aramu xuu' guri gweér. Elisha iri oó', «Mahaangw tsaxareek.» Qoomár waawutmo mahaangw nguwa tsaxaár, aarusmo ina adaá oó', «Kuúng an mahángw AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kudá' múk Aramu gi baál. A slaqwá' nee múk Aramu baraá Afekír wa ale ay dír kay bal.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha waawutmo guri báy, «Maheeraá hatlá' oohang nee ki yaamií tsaxát.» Waawutmo maheeridá' giri yaamií tlaquút sagaáwa tám. Kár tlaqooro giri máy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha iri ló'wa daa/atúy buhhtaawo, waawutmo guri báy, «Ahaá a milá maheeri misa tlaqutká ay wai kooán laqaá lahhoó'? Adoorí geera bara tléhh múk Aramu u hhaamís ló'wa ale. Hám daxta múk Aramu u bál wai tám kilós.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha iri gwaá', kway foól.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy umuú kurko bir iimu/uu/ún daqtá múk Moabu in haratlaatleér baraá yaamaá Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomarka wake muu iwa heé foliiti, daqtá slaqwaruuse kana ár, tuuadá' ngiri kwahhiyé' baraá /aantár aáng Elisha kway foól, inooín niri gowiyé'. Tuuadá' fadaá Elisha ngiwa kwatít, ina waaslé/, iri sihhít ar ya'aawós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Hasaeli oo Aramu múk Israeli guna ló'wa baramaanuús qooma sleémeero ar waawuti'iimár Yehoahasiwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
